abstract: "A continuously maintained, source-checked map of post-quantum cryptography in blockchains: a stage tracker website that rates each chain from stage 0 to 5 against primary sources (the CoinGecko top 100 with their own networks, plus post-quantum native and early projects), a weekly network patrol, project deployments, signing parameters and charts generated from the data, and a Bitcoin migration research note. Each entry carries its own review date. Website: https://balance0014.github.io/post-quantum-blockchains/"
